 "sentences": [
  "A prisoner of war discovered the neutron.",
  "James Chadwick studied physics under Ernest Rutherford before winning a 1935 Nobel Prize.",
  "While researching radiation in Berlin, World War I broke out.",
  "Chadwick spent 4 years trapped in an internment camp.",
  "Later, he led the British team on the Manhattan Project.",
  "He eventually wrote the report that kickstarted atomic bomb research.",
  "By 1945, he was knighted for his nuclear achievements."
